---
name: aspect-ratio
type: registry:ui
title: Aspect Ratio
description: Displays content within a fixed aspect ratio.
dependencies:
  - bits-ui
files:
  - path: index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/aspect-ratio/index.ts'
  - path: aspect-ratio.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/aspect-ratio/aspect-ratio.svelte'
---

Use aspect ratio to constrain media or other content to a consistent width-to-height proportion.
Pass `ratio` as a number (for example `16 / 9` or `1`).

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import { AspectRatio } from '$lib/components/ui/aspect-ratio/index.js';
</script>

<div class="w-[450px]">
	<AspectRatio ratio={16 / 9} class="bg-muted">
		<img
			src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1588345921523-c2dcdb7f1dcd?w=800&dpr=2&q=80"
			alt="Gray by Drew Beamer"
			class="h-full w-full rounded-md object-cover"
		/>
	</AspectRatio>
</div>
```
